status":"open","summary":"The source has truncated or unavailable content. Missing regions were not checked."}],"model_calls":0,"no_progress_steps":0,"output_tokens":0,"pending_reviews":[],"record":{"canonical_json":"{\"bibliographic\":{\"abstract\":\"The structural and electronic properties of cubic double perovskite BaCoWO6 have been investigated using the X- ray photoelectron spectroscopy (XPS) and X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS) . While Extended X-ray Absorption Fine structure (EXAFS)  studies provide structural information regarding the local environment of Co in Ba2CoWO6, the combined XPS and Co-K edge XAS spectra of Ba2CoWO6 (using Co-foil as a reference) elucidate the electronic properties. We find that the oxidation states for Co, Ba and W can be unambiguously assigned to +2, +2 and +6, respectively.\",\"affiliations\":[{\"id\":\"aff_1\",\"label\":\"1\",\"text\":\"Department of Physics, T.M. Bhagalpur University, Bhagalpur-812007, Bihar\"},{\"id\":\"aff_2\",\"label\":\"2\",\"text\":\"Variable Energy Cyclotron Center (VECC), DAE, 1/AF Bidhannagar, Kolkata, India 700064\"},{\"id\":\"aff_3\",\"label\":\"3\",\"text\":\"Homi Bhabha National Institute, Mumbai, India 400094\"},{\"id\":\"aff_4\",\"label\":\"4\",\"text\":\"UGC-DAE-CSR, Indore-Madhya Pradesh-452017, India\"},{\"id\":\"aff_5\",\"label\":\"5\",\"text\":\"Department of Physics, NIT Jamshedpur, Jamshedpur, India\"},{\"id\":\"aff_6\",\"label\":\"6\",\"text\":\"Bhabha Atomic Research Center (BARC), Trombay, Mumbai, India 400085\"},{\"id\":\"aff_7\",\"label\":\"7\",\"text\":\"S N Bose Institute, Kolkata, India -700106\"},{\"id\":\"aff_8\",\"label\":\"8\",\"text\":\"Bose Institute, 93/1, APC Road, Kolkata, India 700009\"},{\"id\":\"aff_9\",\"label\":\"9\",\"text\":\"IFW Dresden, Helmholtzstr. 20, 01069 Dresden, Germany\"},{\"id\":\"aff_10\",\"label\":\"10\",\"text\":\"Dresden Center for Computational Materials Science (DCMS), TU Dresden, 01062 Dresden, Germany\"}],\"arxiv_id\":null,\"authors\":[{\"affili